<season>
  <plot>**[Alabasta Saga]**

After melting away the threats on Little Garden, Luffy’s gang is one step closer to helping Vivi put an end to her homeland's civil war. But in the midst of heading to Alabasta, the crew faces another roadblock as Nami falls ill! Drifting to the icy Drum Kingdom, Luffy's willing to take just about anyone who could heal Nami’s illness -- whether it be a feisty old witch-lady or a talking reindeer! In their desperate search for a doctor, the Straw Hats will have to fight through snow, ice, rabbits, and a very, *very* hungry king. Will they find a doctor in time, or could this race against the clock be a fight even the Straw Hats can't win?</plot>
